WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Captain Lu also sits down and shares a bowl with you.

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,280
Yes, captain, sit here

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:17,920
Not happy. You guys eat delicious food.

4
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:25,860
It’s better to follow the eldest sister and have some meat to eat, Captain Lu.

5
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,060
Since your people won't eat the food from our base, take the food back

6
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,980
Base food cannot be wasted, Captain Wang

7
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,460
Materials are divided into heads

8
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,180
It's their business whether to eat or not.

9
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,460
Whatever they save is at their own disposal.

10
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,620
Why does this Lu Qiyan always help outsiders?

11
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:40,260
If it weren't for the fact that his family had some food distribution in the north,

12
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:45,920
My dad and I have been sharing food with each other. Who is that girl, Wang Mowei?

13
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,360
Her father was not righteous in his previous life
